Description:It is your second main phase. You control no creatures and have Phyrexian Dreadnought and Fling in hand, with three red mana floating. The opponent is at 12 life and controls a tapped Silent Arbiter. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-respond-own-trigger-lki | A triggered ability waits on the stack and you get priority before it resolves (CR 603.3, 117.3c): cast Phyrexian Dreadnought, and with its sacrifice trigger on the stack Fling it, dealing damage equal to its last-known power of 12 (CR 608.2h); once the trigger resolves the Dreadnought is gone
